{"quest_id": 4628, "name": "神託の聖職者", "description": "砂漠に出現した魔物を討伐すべく\n遠征に出た王子たちだったが……。\n＜出撃時の初期ＨＰ減少：小＞\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "modifier_notes": ["出撃時の初期ＨＰ減少：小"], "event": "天使たちの陰謀", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920070, "map_no": 3191, "level": 80, "multiplier": 0.8, "charisma": 15, "exp": 140, "gold": 500, "drops": [{"card": 375, "c": 1}, {"card": 55, "c": 1}, {"item": 1001, "c": 1}], "capacity": 8, "modifiers": [{"kind": "term", "influence": 9, "params": [20], "expression": "!IsPlayerSupportUnit();"}], "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 3200, "attack": 240, "base_hp": 4000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 121, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098336, "special_effect_id": 227, "master_id": 89, "global_id": 88, "spawn_sec": 3}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 7, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 960, "attack": 240, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_speed": 10, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 49, "move_speed": 1500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098416, "race_id": 2, "master_id": 85, "global_id": 84, "spawn_sec": 7}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 800, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_range": 170, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 25, "attack_interval": 131, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098432, "race_id": 2, "missile_id": 15, "missile": {"speed": 2.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 87, "global_id": 86, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 42}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2400, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 30, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_range": 210, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 151, "move_speed": 350.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2106576, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 836, "global_id": 835, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 46}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 14, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2000, "attack": 240, "base_hp": 2500, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 156, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2101072, "race_id": 6, "master_id": 648, "global_id": 647, "spawn_sec": 48}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "アサル", "text": "魔物の出現の報告があった地点はこのあたりです。\n凶悪な魔物ではないとのことですが\n警戒は怠らないで下さい。", "face": "u172"}, {"name": "砂漠兵士", "text": "おい、王子！\n前方に敵影を確認したぜ。\n見たところ大した数じゃなさそうだ。", "face": "u169"}, {"name": "ハシム", "text": "ふむ、どうやらアサルが得た情報は\n正しかったようだな。俺の経験からいって、\nこれは楽な戦いとなるだろう、がっはっは！", "face": "u170"}, {"name": "アサル", "text": "ハシムさん……。\n豊富な経験は時として油断に繋がります。\n今一度、気を引き締めて下さい。", "face": "u172"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "魔物が迫ってきています！\n王子も油断なさらぬよう、\n戦いの準備をお願い致します！", "face": "l7321c8eb4085"}]}, {"trigger": "battle", "at_sec": 52, "lines": [{"name": "？？？", "text": "あの風貌、そして魔物との戦いぶり……。\n間違いありません、あの者こそが王子でしょう。", "face": "u375"}, {"name": "天使", "text": "聖なる徒、セレイナよ……\n……よくぞ我らを導いてくれました。", "face": "l78025fce4bde"}, {"name": "天使", "text": "これより……浄化を開始します……。\n神に仇なす叛逆の徒を共に倒しましょう。", "face": "l78025fce4bde"}, {"name": "セレイナ", "text": "はい、天使様。\n全ては、主の御心のままに……。", "face": "u375"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "――ッ！？\n王子、気をつけて下さい！\n魔物とは別に何者かが接近してきます！", "face": "l7321c8eb4085"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "セレイナ", "text": "そんな……天使様が、負けた……？", "face": "u375"}, {"name": "セレイナ", "text": "いえ、これは何かの間違いです……！\nここは一度退き、\n再びの浄化に備えるとしましょう。", "face": "u375"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "行ってしまいましたね……。\n彼女はいったい何者だったのでしょうか？", "face": "l7321c8eb4085"}, {"name": "アリサ", "text": "あの方は……おそらくセレイナ様でしょう。", "face": "u24"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "アリサさん、あの方を知っているのですか？", "face": "l7321c8eb4085"}, {"name": "アリサ", "text": "はい……セレイナ様は神託を授かる事が\nできる方で、聖職者の間では有名な存在です。", "face": "u24"}, {"name": "アサル", "text": "神からの言葉を授かる事が出来る方が\nなぜ王子を襲うのでしょうか……？\n再度の襲撃を考えているようでしたし……。", "face": "u172"}, {"name": "アリサ", "text": "すみません、そこまでは私も……。", "face": "u24"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "何はともあれ、このまま神殿へと\n帰還すれば後をつけられる\n可能性がありますね……。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "そうですね。\nそれでは予定を変更し、海路にて敵の\n追撃を避けながら神殿へと向かいましょう。", "face": "l7321c8eb4085"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920070_3191", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 20, "y": 172}, {"k": "m", "x": 809, "y": 507, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 126, "y": 328, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 162, "y": 421, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 95, "y": 222, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 280, "y": 444, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 405, "y": 469, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 553, "y": 496, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 510, "y": 386, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 841, "y": 438, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 743, "y": 390, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 593, "y": 311, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 721, "y": 296, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 678, "y": 506, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 803, "y": 238, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 787, "y": 151, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 249, "y": 144, "id": 215}, {"k": "m", "x": 201, "y": 215, "id": 216}, {"k": "m", "x": 212, "y": 295, "id": 217}, {"k": "m", "x": 264, "y": 365, "id": 218}, {"k": "m", "x": 683, "y": 111, "id": 219}, {"k": "m", "x": 319, "y": 290, "id": 220}, {"k": 